  "wildlife_location": "open-plains",
  "description": "Canyon Overlook faces a broad frontier landscape cut by a blue river. The water bends between ochre rock banks and dry grassy islands, with a timber bridge crossing near the centre. A dusty path approaches the bridge from the lower foreground, passing scattered boulders, low shrubs and prickly plants. Clumps of green trees follow the water, while reddish cliffs and mesas rise farther back. A painted sign on the upper-left bank reads Dusty River. The open ground and winding water make this a long view into the landscape, rather than a sheltered indoor room.",
